/target
**/*.rs.bk

# Cargo.lock is the only pinning anchor in this tree and must never be ignored.
# A bare `*.lock` would match it, which is why these patterns are anchored to a
# repo-local state root instead of floating free.
!Cargo.lock

# A local state root, if someone points IDBOARD_HOME inside the checkout.
# Keys, locks, pids, databases, and sockets are never shared.
/.idboard/
